{"archivedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","archivedInDashboard":false,"attachedStylesheets":[],"authorName":"Shawn Peterson","categoryId":1,"contentTypeCategory":4,"createdAt":"2026-08-07T20:12:06.411Z","createdById":"26261533","currentState":"DRAFT","domain":"info.davincilabs.com","featuredImage":"","featuredImageAltText":"","htmlTitle":"Private Label Gummy Supplements | DaVinci Private Label","id":"218946510174","language":"en","layoutSections":{"main_content":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"Main Content","name":"main_content","params":{},"rowMetaData":[{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"},{"cssClass":"dnd-section"}],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_0","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Hero","name":"module_0","params":{"align":"center","background_image":{"background_position":"MIDDLE_CENTER","background_size":"cover","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg"},"background_screen":{"color":"#c9dbe2","opacity":85},"buttons":[{"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"#get-started","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"style":"primary","text":"Talk to Our Team"}],"eyebrow":"PRIVATE LABEL GUMMIES","eyebrow_color":"heading","headline":"<h1>Launch your supplement line in gummies, customer-ready.</h1>","max_width":900,"module_id":218939846507,"section_id":"","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#c9dbe2","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":90,"padding_top":90}},"subhead":"<p>Doctor-formulated supplements available in gummies format, ready to brand as your own and ship to your customers.</p>","text_color":"dark"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_1","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Rich Text","name":"module_1","params":{"align":"left","body_size":18,"content":"<h2>Why brands choose gummies as a supplement format.</h2><p>Different audiences prefer different delivery formats. Gummies are a category-leading choice when your customers want a specific combination of convenience, dosing precision, and ingredient compatibility.</p><p>With direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements, low minimums, and no set-up fees, you can quickly build a gummies-based product line that fits your audience. Below is what to know about manufacturing gummies for private label: the formulations we offer, the specs available, how we make them, and which health categories benefit most.</p>","max_width":850,"module_id":218940115784,"section_id":"","size":"normal","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#FFFFFF","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":50,"padding_top":80}},"text_color":"dark","top_border":false},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_2","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Card Grid","name":"module_2","params":{"card_align":"left","card_style":"plain","cards":[{"content":"<p>Direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements with low minimums and no set-up fees. Choose what fits your audience and your timeline.</p>","number_or_eyebrow":"01","title":"BUILD YOUR PRODUCT LINE"},{"content":"<p>Use your existing logo, customize a new label, or pick from our professional templates. Our in-house design team brings your vision to life.</p>","number_or_eyebrow":"02","title":"DESIGN YOUR BRAND"},{"content":"<p>Launch in as little as 3 to 4 weeks after approving your labels. Every product passes rigorous quality assurance before it ships.</p>","number_or_eyebrow":"03","title":"START SELLING FAST"}],"eyebrow_style":"text","gap":40,"max_width":1100,"min_column_width":260,"module_id":218940115759,"section_eyebrow":"HOW IT WORKS","section_headline":"Get to market faster with a partner who handles the heavy lifting.","section_subhead":"","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#c9dbe2","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":70,"padding_top":70}},"text_color":"dark","title_style":"eyebrow-caps"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_3","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Card Grid","name":"module_3","params":{"accent_color":{"color":"#6BA644","opacity":100},"card_align":"left","card_style":"card","cards":[{"content":"<p>Gummies are the fastest-growing supplement format in consumer health, especially with millennial and Gen Z audiences. The right choice when your brand wants to ride a high-momentum category.</p>","icon":{"alt":"","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-330bfa2ad5.svg"},"title":"Fastest-growing supplement format"},{"content":"<p>Gummies feel like a treat, not a pill. Strong fit for daily-supplement positioning where taste and ease matter. Particularly effective for product categories where compliance (taking the supplement daily) is the main customer barrier.</p>","icon":{"alt":"","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-e2f38469a7.svg"},"title":"High-palatability, broad appeal"},{"content":"<p>Traditional gelatin-and-sugar formulations or modern sugar-free, pectin-based vegan formulations. Sugar-free positioning has become the default for new launches.</p>","icon":{"alt":"","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-0e742f57f3.svg"},"title":"Sugar-free and pectin-based options"}],"eyebrow_style":"text","gap":28,"icon_badge":true,"icon_badge_color":{"color":"#c9dbe2","opacity":100},"icon_tile":true,"icon_tile_color":{"color":"#c9dbe2","opacity":100},"max_width":1100,"min_column_width":260,"module_id":218940115759,"section_eyebrow":"ADVANTAGES","section_headline":"What makes gummies a strong supplement format.","section_subhead":"","show_accent":true,"style":{"background_color":{"color":"#f7f7f6","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":70,"padding_top":70}},"text_color":"dark","title_style":"heading"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_4","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Section Header","name":"module_4","params":{"align":"center","eyebrow":"SPECIFICATIONS","headline":"Manufacturing specs available for private label gummies.","module_id":218940115771,"section_id":"","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#FFFFFF","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":30,"padding_top":70}},"subhead":"<p>The most common questions from brand owners are about sizes, materials, fill capacity, and minimums. Here is the short answer for each.</p>","text_color":"dark"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_5","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Stat Band","name":"module_5","params":{"accent_color":{"color":"#012638","opacity":100},"align":"left","card_style":"card","gap":24,"max_width":1200,"min_column_width":240,"module_id":218940115735,"section_headline":"","stats":[{"description":"<p>Standard bear, ring, and square shapes available with no tooling cost. Custom shapes (brand logos, mascots, themed designs) available for higher-volume runs.</p>","icon":{"alt":"Shapes &amp; Sizes","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-7389db2445.svg"},"stat_label":"Shapes &amp; Sizes","value":"Standard or Custom"},{"description":"<p>Gelatin-based gummies are traditional and lower-cost. Pectin-based gummies are vegan, kosher, halal compatible, and have become standard for new launches with clean-label positioning.</p>","icon":{"alt":"Base Options","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-0e742f57f3.svg"},"stat_label":"Base Options","value":"Gelatin or Pectin"},{"description":"<p>Traditional cane sugar formulations for taste-forward positioning. Sugar-free using allulose, monk fruit, or stevia for low-sugar positioning. Mixed natural-fruit formulations also available.</p>","icon":{"alt":"Sweetener Options","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-e2f38469a7.svg"},"stat_label":"Sweetener Options","value":"Sugar / Sugar-Free"},{"description":"<p>Gummy manufacturing has higher minimums than other formats due to depositing line setup and drying time. No set-up fees, but lead time and MOQ are scoped carefully during discovery.</p>","icon":{"alt":"Minimums &amp; Set-Up","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-681f7474d8.svg"},"stat_label":"Minimums &amp; Set-Up","value":"Higher MOQ"}],"style":{"background_color":{"color":"#FFFFFF","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":80,"padding_top":80}},"text_color":"dark","value_size":28},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_6","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Content Split","name":"module_6","params":{"buttons":[],"content":"<p>Gummies are manufactured on starch-molding and pectin-deposit lines. The base is cooked, actives are blended in at controlled temperature, the slurry is deposited into starch or silicone molds, then dried, demolded, and finished with a thin oil or wax coating for non-stick handling. Every batch goes through identity, purity, potency, microbial, and (critically) active-stability testing before release, since heat exposure during cooking can affect sensitive ingredients.</p>","eyebrow":"MANUFACTURING","gap":60,"headline":"How we manufacture gummies for private label.","image":{"alt":"Gummies product photo placeholder","height":800,"loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/placeholders/pl-placeholder-gummies.svg","width":1200},"image_radius":6,"image_shadow":false,"image_side":"left","max_width":1100,"module_id":218939846527,"ratio":"1fr 1fr","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#012638","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":90,"padding_top":90}},"text_color":"light"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_7","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - CTA Band","name":"module_7","params":{"background_screen":{"color":"#012638","opacity":0},"buttons":[{"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"#get-started","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"style":"primary","text":"Request Samples"}],"content":"<p>Want to see gummies samples or talk through your formulation?</p>","eyebrow":"","headline":"","max_width":800,"module_id":218940115731,"section_id":"","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#c9dbe2","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":50,"padding_top":50}},"text_color":"dark"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_8","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Tile Grid","name":"module_8","params":{"columns":"auto","gap":24,"image_fit":"cover","image_height":160,"image_max_width":0,"min_column_width":180,"module_id":218940115743,"section_headline":"Categories where gummies shine","section_subhead":"<p>Some health categories work better in gummies than others. Here are the ones where this format is the natural choice.</p>","show_labels_over_image":false,"style":{"background_color":{"color":"#f7f7f6","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":80,"padding_top":80}},"text_color":"dark","tile_style":"card","tiles":[{"image":{"alt":"Women's Health","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/womenssupps.png"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"/private-label-womens-health","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Women's Health"},{"image":{"alt":"Sleep","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/sleepsupps.png"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"/private-label-sleep","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Sleep"},{"image":{"alt":"Probiotics","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/probioticsupps.png"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"/private-label-probiotics","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Probiotics"},{"image":{"alt":"Aging","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/agingsupps.png"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"/private-label-aging","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Aging"},{"image":{"alt":"Fitness","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/fitnesssupps.png"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"/private-label-fitness","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Fitness"}]},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_9","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - FAQ","name":"module_9","params":{"items":[{"answer":"<p>Gelatin gummies are made from animal-derived gelatin (most often bovine or porcine). Pectin gummies are made from fruit-derived pectin and are vegan, kosher, and halal compatible. Pectin gummies tend to have a slightly firmer texture and are now the standard for new product launches due to broader audience appeal.</p>","question":"What is the difference between gelatin and pectin gummies?"},{"answer":"<p>Yes. Sugar-free gummies using allulose, monk fruit, stevia, or sugar alcohol combinations are available. Allulose-based formulations have the closest mouthfeel to traditional sugar without the glycemic impact. Sugar-free is now the default request for most new gummy launches.</p>","question":"Can you do sugar-free gummies?"},{"answer":"<p>Gummy production requires depositing line setup, mold preparation, and 24-48 hour drying cycles. The economics of starting a run mean minimum order volumes are higher than for tablet or capsule runs. We are direct about these minimums during the discovery call so you can plan inventory accordingly.</p>","question":"Why are gummy minimums higher than other formats?"},{"answer":"<p>Gummies can soften or melt in high-heat shipping conditions. We use packaging and shipping practices designed to minimize heat exposure (insulated packaging in summer months, climate-aware fulfillment timing). Some gummies are formulated for higher heat tolerance, which is scoped during formulation if it matters for your audience.</p>","question":"Are gummies heat-stable for shipping?"},{"answer":"<p>Cooking-sensitive actives are added at controlled temperatures and verified through finished-product testing on every batch. We over-formulate certain heat-sensitive ingredients (within FDA-allowed tolerance) to ensure the label claim is met at end of shelf life, not just at production.</p>","question":"How do you verify active dose in gummies given the cooking process?"}],"max_width":820,"module_id":218940115739,"open_first":false,"section_eyebrow":"","section_headline":"Gummies questions we hear most often","section_id":"","section_subhead":"<p>Quick answers to the questions brand owners ask before they commit.</p>","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#FFFFFF","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":80,"padding_top":80}},"text_color":"dark"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_10","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Tile Grid","name":"module_10","params":{"columns":"auto","gap":24,"image_fit":"contain","image_height":180,"image_max_width":180,"min_column_width":160,"module_id":218940115743,"section_headline":"Other supplement forms we offer","section_subhead":"<p>Most brands launch with two or three formats to give customers options. Here is the full list of formats we manufacture.</p>","show_labels_over_image":false,"style":{"background_color":{"color":"#f7f7f6","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":80,"padding_top":80}},"text_color":"dark","tile_style":"plain","tiles":[{"image":{"alt":"Capsules","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_Capsules.jpg"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Capsules"},{"image":{"alt":"Tablets","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_Tablets.jpg"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Tablets"},{"image":{"alt":"Soft Gels","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_SoftGel.jpg"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Soft Gels"},{"image":{"alt":"Powders","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_Powders.jpg"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Powders"},{"image":{"alt":"Chewables","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_ChewableTablet.jpg"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Chewables"},{"image":{"alt":"Liquids","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_Liquid.jpg"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Liquids"},{"image":{"alt":"Oral Sprays","loading":"lazy","size_type":"auto","src":"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_Spray.jpg"},"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"tile_label":"Oral Sprays"}]},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_11","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Global Product Guide Link","name":"module_11","params":{"module_id":218942529660},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_12","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - CTA Band","name":"module_12","params":{"background_screen":{"color":"#012638","opacity":0},"buttons":[{"link":{"no_follow":false,"open_in_new_tab":false,"url":{"href":"#get-started","type":"EXTERNAL"}},"style":"primary","text":"Schedule a Consultation"}],"content":"<p>Schedule a consultation and we will walk through formulation options, packaging, branding, and the timeline. Most brands launch within 3 to 4 weeks of approving labels, 8 to 12 weeks from first conversation.</p>","eyebrow":"","headline":"Ready to launch your supplement line in gummies?","max_width":720,"module_id":218940115731,"section_id":"get-started","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#e6e5e3","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":80,"padding_top":80}},"text_color":"dark"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_13","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Global Guide Offer","name":"module_13","params":{"module_id":218944099153},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_14","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Section Header","name":"module_14","params":{"align":"center","eyebrow":"50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING","headline":"Developed by us. Made for you.","module_id":218940115771,"section_id":"","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#e6e5e3","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":0,"padding_top":90}},"subhead":"","text_color":"dark"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_15","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Rich Text","name":"module_15","params":{"align":"center","body_size":17,"content":"<p>With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p><p>FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p><p>When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:50px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:40px 0 0;\"><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" width=\"177\" height=\"80\" style=\"height:80px;width:auto;max-width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" width=\"55\" height=\"80\" style=\"height:80px;width:auto;max-width:100%;\"></p>","max_width":900,"module_id":218940115784,"section_id":"","size":"normal","style":{"background_color":{"color":"#e6e5e3","opacity":100},"padding":{"padding_bottom":90,"padding_top":24}},"text_color":"dark","top_border":false},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","name":"column_16","params":{"css_class":"dnd-column"},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[{"0":{"cells":[],"cssClass":"","cssId":"","cssStyle":"","label":"PL - Global FDA Disclaimer","name":"module_16","params":{"module_id":218942529652},"rowMetaData":[],"rows":[],"type":"module","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}}],"type":"cell","w":0,"x":0}},"metaDescription":"Private label gummy supplements. Best for vitamin D, ADK, multivitamin and immune formulations targeting consumer-friendly compliance.","name":"Private Label - Page - Gummies — V3 (New Modules)","pageRedirected":false,"publicAccessRules":[],"publicAccessRulesEnabled":false,"publishDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","published":false,"slug":"pl-demo-gummies-v3","state":"DRAFT","subcategory":"site_page","templatePath":"Private Label/Templates/Page - DND.html","translations":{},"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T20:53:53.507Z","updatedById":"26261533","url":"https://info.davincilabs.com/pl-demo-gummies-v3","useFeaturedImage":false,"widgetContainers":{"main_content":{"deleted_at":1786126404643,"widgets":[]}},"widgets":{}}